### ============================================
### MENU SERVICE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================
### Base URL: http://localhost:8081/api/stoplists

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@path = /api/v1/stoplists
@id = 1
@menuitemId = 1

### Create a discounts item
### Request Body: StopListDto
### Response: Created StopListDto
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "menuItemId": 1,
  "branchId": 1,
  "startDate": "2024-06-15",
  "endDate": "2024-06-20",
  "reason": "Supplier delay"
}

### Get stoplists by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: StopListDto
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get all stoplists in a menuitem
### Request Body: -
### Response: List<StopListDto>
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/menuitem/{menuitemId}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update stoplists by ID
### Request Body: StopListDto
### Response: Updated StopListDto
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete stoplists by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: No content (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json